<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns A- to Samsung Elec mark Eurobond.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns A- to Samsung Elec mark Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard and Poor's Corp (S&amp;P) said on Friday that it had assigned its A- rating to Samsung Electronics Co's 300 million mark Eurobond due in 2001.</p>
<p>The outlook for the rating was stable, S&amp;P said in a statement.</p>
</text>
